    "url": "https://aeromarknj.com/",
    "title": "Aeromark Mechanical, Family-owned HVAC & mechanical contracting, North Jersey",
    "lang": "en",
    "metaDescription": "Family-owned HVAC and mechanical contractor in East Rutherford, NJ. Heating, cooling and new-construction mechanical for homes, builders and multifamily projects.",
    "h1": [
